{"timestamp": "2026-02-04 19:36:27.136739", "event": "llm_start", "messages": "content='Based on the diagnosis report: ### Troubleshooting Diagnosis Report\\n\\n#### Network Health Assessment:\\nThe network appears to be experiencing significant issues with reachability. Based on the ping results, all tests between hosts, servers, and infrastructure devices have returned a status of \"unknown.\" This indicates that there is a fundamental problem preventing communication across the network.\\n\\n#### Observed Anomalies:\\n1. **Reachability Issues**:\\n   - None of the hosts, servers, or infrastructure devices are able to successfully ping each other.\\n   - The lack of any valid ping results (e.g., transmitted packets, received packets, RTT metrics) suggests a widespread connectivity failure.\\n\\n2. **Infrastructure and Server Communication**:\\n   - Key servers such as the DHCP server, DNS server, and web servers are unable to communicate with hosts.\\n   - The load balancer, which is critical for distributing traffic to backend web servers, also shows no connectivity.\\n\\n3. **Host-to-Host Communication**:\\n   - Hosts within the same subnet and across different subnets are unable to reach each other.\\n\\n#### Relevant Findings:\\n- The issue is not isolated to a specific segment of the network; it affects all layers, including access, distribution, and core.\\n- The problem may stem from a misconfiguration or failure in the routing protocol (OSPF), as it is responsible for advertising routes across the network.\\n- Alternatively, there could be a failure in the physical or logical connectivity between devices, such as switch or router interfaces being down or misconfigured.\\n\\n#### Next Steps:\\nFurther investigation is required to pinpoint the root cause of the connectivity issues. This will involve:\\n1. Verifying the OSPF configuration and status on all routers.\\n2. Checking the network configuration and interface status on switches and routers.\\n3. Examining logs and counters on switches and routers for anomalies.\\n4. Testing individual device connectivity to isolate the problem.\\n\\nThis report highlights the current state of the network and identifies areas requiring deeper analysis., please provide the submission. Do not submit if no report available.' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={} id='3f829f24-a836-4865-8a61-bdbe9dca9d75'", "model": {"lc": 1, "type": "constructor", "id": ["langchain", "chat_models", "openai", "ChatOpenAI"], "kwargs": {"model_name": "kt-gpt-oss-rh014", "temperature": 0.0, "openai_api_key": {"lc": 1, "type": "secret", "id": ["OPENAI_API_KEY"]}, "openai_api_base": "https://dev.kora.kt.co.kr/v2", "request_timeout": 180.0, "max_retries": 2}, "name": "ChatOpenAI"}}
